Subject: [PATCH] docs(site): glossary of CamCraft terms

A glossary page for the guide: 33 terms, alphabetical, each one or two
sentences on how CamCraft uses the term, linked to the guide page that
covers it. The guide index links to it.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Fixes #1249
